WEBVTT

1
00:00:43.041 --> 00:00:45.416
In verses 12.6

2
00:00:45.416 --> 00:00:47.416
and 12.7,

3
00:00:47.416 --> 00:00:48.416
Lord Krishna explains the ease

4
00:00:48.416 --> 00:00:49.500
with which liberation

5
00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:53.166
can be attained on the path of devotion.

6
00:00:53.166 --> 00:00:55.916
In these verses, Lord Krishna says

7
00:00:55.916 --> 00:00:57.125
that, O Arjuna,

8
00:00:57.125 --> 00:00:58.875
those devotees who surrender

9
00:00:58.875 --> 00:01:02.000
all their actions to Me, who fix

10
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.083
their minds in Me alone and
constantly meditate on Me,

11
00:01:06.083 --> 00:01:09.875
and who worship Me with complete sincerity –

12
00:01:09.875 --> 00:01:12.000
such devotees I Myself

13
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.458
rescue from this endless ocean

14
00:01:15.458 --> 00:01:16.958
of birth and death.

15
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:24.958
Through these verses, Lord Krishna clearly

16
00:01:24.958 --> 00:01:26.791
explains the difference

17
00:01:26.791 --> 00:01:29.041
between the two paths to liberation.

18
00:01:29.041 --> 00:01:32.916
On one side is the path of formless practice,

19
00:01:32.916 --> 00:01:34.625
described by Lord Krishna

20
00:01:34.625 --> 00:01:36.208
in the previous verses,

21
00:01:36.208 --> 00:01:40.083
and the other is the path of complete devotion.

22
00:01:40.083 --> 00:01:42.416
On the path of formless practice,

23
00:01:42.416 --> 00:01:45.333
the seeker must struggle alone

24
00:01:45.333 --> 00:01:48.958
and face many hardships too.

25
00:01:48.958 --> 00:01:51.750
But here, Lord Krishna makes clear

26
00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:54.958
that those devotees who keep
their minds fixed in Him

27
00:01:54.958 --> 00:01:56.958
and surrender themselves

28
00:01:56.958 --> 00:01:58.958
fully in devotion –

29
00:01:58.958 --> 00:02:01.708
such devotees Lord Krishna Himself carries

30
00:02:01.708 --> 00:02:06.208
across this ocean of sorrow,
that is birth and death.

31
00:02:06.208 --> 00:02:08.458
Aham samuddharta –

32
00:02:08.458 --> 00:02:10.791
the meaning of these words in the verse is:

33
00:02:10.791 --> 00:02:11.583
I Myself

34
00:02:11.583 --> 00:02:12.375
pull them out

35
00:02:12.375 --> 00:02:15.541
from the cycle of birth and death.

36
00:02:15.541 --> 00:02:16.916
It is just like

37
00:02:16.916 --> 00:02:17.958
a strong person

38
00:02:17.958 --> 00:02:19.791
pulling a drowning one with their own hands

39
00:02:19.791 --> 00:02:23.208
out of the water and saving them.

40
00:02:23.208 --> 00:02:26.666
This is the complete opposite

41
00:02:26.666 --> 00:02:28.000
of the formless path,

42
00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:31.541
where the seeker struggles alone.

43
00:02:31.541 --> 00:02:34.333
Understand this with another example.

44
00:02:34.333 --> 00:02:35.500
Imagine

45
00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:36.333
someone

46
00:02:36.333 --> 00:02:37.916
is trying to climb a mountain

47
00:02:37.916 --> 00:02:39.916
holding a rope.

48
00:02:39.916 --> 00:02:42.833
If the end of that rope is tied to a steady rock

49
00:02:42.833 --> 00:02:46.458
or a tree, then all the effort of climbing

50
00:02:46.458 --> 00:02:48.958
must come from that person alone.

51
00:02:48.958 --> 00:02:53.000
The path of formless practice is just like this.

52
00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:54.791
But if at the other end

53
00:02:54.791 --> 00:02:56.708
of the rope there is a well-wisher,

54
00:02:56.708 --> 00:03:01.750
they can also pull with
their strength and bring you up.

55
00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:03.750
This is the path of devotion,

56
00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:06.125
where the devotee makes the effort,

57
00:03:06.125 --> 00:03:07.041
but Lord Krishna

58
00:03:07.041 --> 00:03:11.000
also helps from the other end.

59
00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:13.041
Bhavami na chirat –

60
00:03:13.041 --> 00:03:16.041
the meaning of these words in verse 12.7 is:

61
00:03:16.041 --> 00:03:18.000
without much delay.

62
00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:21.000
This is an assurance from Lord Krishna

63
00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:23.000
that those walking the path

64
00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:24.500
of complete devotion, Lord Krishna

65
00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:28.500
does not delay in rescuing them
from this ocean of sorrow.

66
00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:31.416
While other paths leading to
liberation may require

67
00:03:31.416 --> 00:03:34.250
many lifetimes of practice,

68
00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:35.666
on the path of devotion

69
00:03:35.666 --> 00:03:36.666
this liberation

70
00:03:36.666 --> 00:03:39.625
is attained quickly and joyfully,

71
00:03:39.625 --> 00:03:42.333
and this is possible only
through complete surrender

72
00:03:42.333 --> 00:03:44.958
and love in devotion.

73
00:03:44.958 --> 00:03:46.791
These two verses reveal

74
00:03:46.791 --> 00:03:49.708
that the path of devotion is not only simple

75
00:03:49.708 --> 00:03:52.916
but also deeply sweet,

76
00:03:52.916 --> 00:03:54.916
where Lord Krishna Himself

77
00:03:54.916 --> 00:03:59.208
becomes, for His devotees,
the companion, protector,

78
00:03:59.208 --> 00:04:01.500
and charioteer all three.

79
00:04:05.833 --> 00:04:10.666
Sometimes moments come in life

80
00:04:10.666 --> 00:04:14.875
when it feels as if, surrounded by problems,

81
00:04:14.875 --> 00:04:17.833
you are fighting your battle alone.

82
00:04:17.833 --> 00:04:22.625
In such moments, it is hard to understand

83
00:04:22.625 --> 00:04:26.666
how to move forward.

84
00:04:26.666 --> 00:04:30.000
But remember one thing –

85
00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:33.708
those who, from a sincere heart,

86
00:04:33.708 --> 00:04:36.416
call out to Me,

87
00:04:36.416 --> 00:04:41.791
I never leave them alone.

88
00:04:41.791 --> 00:04:44.166
I always stand by them.

89
00:04:44.166 --> 00:04:47.583
And some people, waiting

90
00:04:47.583 --> 00:04:49.083
for some miracle,

91
00:04:49.083 --> 00:04:53.250
give up making any effort at all.

92
00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:56.291
In doing so, new possibilities

93
00:04:56.291 --> 00:05:01.833
they fail even to recognise.

94
00:05:01.833 --> 00:05:06.833
Devotion means unwavering trust.

95
00:05:06.833 --> 00:05:09.208
Devotion does not mean

96
00:05:09.208 --> 00:05:12.958
that you sit in despair waiting

97
00:05:12.958 --> 00:05:16.125
for some miracle.

98
00:05:16.125 --> 00:05:19.375
My help will certainly come,

99
00:05:19.375 --> 00:05:23.750
but in different forms.

100
00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:27.791
And that all of it be visible directly –

101
00:05:27.791 --> 00:05:32.416
it is not necessary that I

102
00:05:32.416 --> 00:05:35.708
help you that way.

103
00:05:35.708 --> 00:05:39.500
By lifting your morale,

104
00:05:39.500 --> 00:05:42.541
by clearing the fog from your thoughts

105
00:05:42.541 --> 00:05:45.916
I clear the way.

106
00:05:45.916 --> 00:05:50.416
I also create such circumstances

107
00:05:50.416 --> 00:05:54.416
that support you, or else

108
00:05:54.416 --> 00:05:59.291
I will send such a person into your life

109
00:05:59.291 --> 00:06:03.833
who helps pull you out of the problem.

110
00:06:03.833 --> 00:06:08.041
To be able to recognise all this,

111
00:06:08.041 --> 00:06:11.250
you must keep your trust in Me alive,

112
00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:16.083
because then your perspective
will become positive,

113
00:06:16.083 --> 00:06:18.750
and only a positive outlook

114
00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:22.916
can see all of this.

115
00:06:22.916 --> 00:06:24.666
My help

116
00:06:24.666 --> 00:06:28.625
does not always appear directly

117
00:06:28.625 --> 00:06:31.250
this is not necessary,

118
00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:33.916
because My purpose

119
00:06:33.916 --> 00:06:38.666
Because My purpose is not
only to remove your problems,

120
00:06:38.666 --> 00:06:43.250
but also to make you capable too.

121
00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:44.750
That is why,

122
00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:49.500
instead of instantly removing your obstacles,

123
00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:51.625
I often

124
00:06:51.625 --> 00:06:55.666
give you the courage to fight them

125
00:06:55.666 --> 00:06:58.291
and the clarity.

126
00:06:58.291 --> 00:07:00.833
And do not think

127
00:07:00.833 --> 00:07:05.875
that My help will be delayed.

128
00:07:05.875 --> 00:07:10.500
The deeper you remember Me,

129
00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:12.833
the sooner

130
00:07:12.833 --> 00:07:16.958
you will sense My support.

131
00:07:16.958 --> 00:07:21.750
Remember, you are never alone,

132
00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:24.083
because I Myself

133
00:07:24.083 --> 00:07:27.958
am always with you

134
00:07:27.958 --> 00:07:30.708
to guide you.

135
00:07:35.250 --> 00:07:39.375
In family life, many times difficulties

136
00:07:39.375 --> 00:07:42.833
stand before you.

137
00:07:42.833 --> 00:07:46.291
Some financial strain, some external stress,

138
00:07:46.291 --> 00:07:49.666
or sometimes within the family internal

139
00:07:49.666 --> 00:07:53.875
conflict too makes life hard.

140
00:07:53.875 --> 00:07:56.250
Sorrows, unannounced,

141
00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:59.750
arrive and stand before you.

142
00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:03.208
Ordinarily you face these

143
00:08:03.208 --> 00:08:07.250
with courage and mutual understanding.

144
00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:09.291
You support each other,

145
00:08:09.291 --> 00:08:11.458
you help one another.

146
00:08:11.458 --> 00:08:14.083
But sometimes

147
00:08:14.083 --> 00:08:17.833
this burden becomes so heavy

148
00:08:17.833 --> 00:08:22.166
that the mind grows completely weary.

149
00:08:22.166 --> 00:08:26.375
It feels as if, if only someone were there

150
00:08:26.375 --> 00:08:30.750
who could pull you out of this sorrow.

151
00:08:30.750 --> 00:08:35.916
At such times, it feels very lonely.

152
00:08:35.916 --> 00:08:38.125
But remember –

153
00:08:38.125 --> 00:08:39.958
if you

154
00:08:39.958 --> 00:08:42.291
and your family

155
00:08:42.291 --> 00:08:45.208
take shelter in devotion,

156
00:08:45.208 --> 00:08:49.541
then you are never alone,

157
00:08:49.541 --> 00:08:51.416
because I

158
00:08:51.416 --> 00:08:53.250
at every moment

159
00:08:53.250 --> 00:08:56.291
stand with My devotees.

160
00:08:56.291 --> 00:08:58.000
Many people

161
00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:01.250
practise devotion only then

162
00:09:01.250 --> 00:09:05.083
when they happen to have time.

163
00:09:05.083 --> 00:09:06.833
But

164
00:09:06.833 --> 00:09:08.541
devotion is not

165
00:09:08.541 --> 00:09:13.166
an act done merely at convenience.

166
00:09:13.166 --> 00:09:15.333
Devotion is that

167
00:09:15.333 --> 00:09:19.750
where you remember Me always,

168
00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:22.625
whether times are good

169
00:09:22.625 --> 00:09:24.916
or bad.

170
00:09:24.916 --> 00:09:27.750
And such devotion in the family

171
00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:32.125
becomes the foundation of patience and peace.

172
00:09:32.125 --> 00:09:36.000
The home that lovingly invites Me

173
00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:40.458
through remembrance and prayer –

174
00:09:40.458 --> 00:09:46.750
I will be present in that home

175
00:09:46.750 --> 00:09:50.875
and lighten its burden too.

176
00:09:50.875 --> 00:09:54.666
I will lighten this burden.

177
00:09:54.666 --> 00:09:57.625
by increasing your strength,

178
00:09:57.625 --> 00:10:00.250
by increasing your endurance,

179
00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:03.208
by building unity in the family.

180
00:10:03.208 --> 00:10:06.458
In life, for the family's bright

181
00:10:06.458 --> 00:10:11.291
future you make financial investments –

182
00:10:11.291 --> 00:10:14.083
so once,

183
00:10:14.083 --> 00:10:18.250
try investing time in devotion too.

184
00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:19.958
In the family you

185
00:10:19.958 --> 00:10:24.875
will begin to experience many positive changes.

186
00:10:24.875 --> 00:10:27.000
Why?

187
00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:30.416
Because more secure than devotion

188
00:10:30.416 --> 00:10:33.041
there is no other investment.

189
00:10:37.750 --> 00:10:43.458
In professional life, challenges
are entirely natural.

190
00:10:43.458 --> 00:10:47.541
Tight deadlines, sometimes with colleagues

191
00:10:47.541 --> 00:10:52.500
discrimination, sometimes even after full effort

192
00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:54.833
having to accept failure.

193
00:10:54.833 --> 00:10:58.583
Such moments will come when you feel

194
00:10:58.583 --> 00:11:01.791
that you are completely exhausted.

195
00:11:01.791 --> 00:11:04.791
Sometimes it will also seem

196
00:11:04.791 --> 00:11:09.250
that you are fighting this battle alone.

197
00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:13.125
That in an ocean of countless responsibilities

198
00:11:13.125 --> 00:11:18.833
you are simply sinking.

199
00:11:18.833 --> 00:11:21.208
Once,

200
00:11:21.208 --> 00:11:23.041
just once,

201
00:11:23.041 --> 00:11:27.083
try taking shelter in devotion,

202
00:11:27.083 --> 00:11:32.958
try fixing your mind in Me.

203
00:11:32.958 --> 00:11:37.166
You will sense such positivity, endurance,

204
00:11:37.166 --> 00:11:40.833
and inner strength,

205
00:11:40.833 --> 00:11:45.541
that will pull you out of even
the hardest of situations.

206
00:11:45.541 --> 00:11:50.708
Success is not only the name
of external achievements;

207
00:11:50.708 --> 00:11:55.250
success is also that inner stability

208
00:11:55.250 --> 00:11:57.791
that, even in those dire situations,

209
00:11:57.791 --> 00:12:02.708
does not let you falter.

210
00:12:02.708 --> 00:12:05.916
And such stability

211
00:12:05.916 --> 00:12:09.416
only devotion can provide.

212
00:12:09.416 --> 00:12:10.625
Liberation does not mean

213
00:12:10.625 --> 00:12:14.291
that suddenly some miracle occurs;

214
00:12:14.291 --> 00:12:17.250
rather the path of devotion

215
00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:19.083
connects you to that perspective

216
00:12:19.083 --> 00:12:21.833
and that wisdom,

217
00:12:21.833 --> 00:12:26.541
where you begin to see every
problem only through solution

218
00:12:26.541 --> 00:12:30.375
and the eyes of hope,

219
00:12:30.375 --> 00:12:33.625
where no difficulty feels too great,

220
00:12:33.625 --> 00:12:38.041
where you not only overcome the difficulties,

221
00:12:38.041 --> 00:12:39.916
but at the same time

222
00:12:39.916 --> 00:12:43.000
also gain that capacity

223
00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:47.666
which helps make the future brighter.

224
00:12:47.666 --> 00:12:49.708
And yes,

225
00:12:49.708 --> 00:12:51.958
through devotion this change

226
00:12:51.958 --> 00:12:55.166
does not take long to come.

227
00:12:55.166 --> 00:12:58.541
All that is needed

228
00:12:58.541 --> 00:13:03.083
is that the faith in your heart be sincere.

229
00:13:03.083 --> 00:13:07.875
Whoever keeps unbreakable trust in Me,

230
00:13:07.875 --> 00:13:12.750
I always stand by them.

231
00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:14.125
However great

232
00:13:14.125 --> 00:13:17.333
the professional struggle may be,

233
00:13:17.333 --> 00:13:19.500
no devotee of Mine

234
00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:23.250
is ever alone.

235
00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:25.666
I am always with them.
